<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Argentine telcoms raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Argentine telcoms raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it had raised its ratings for Telefonica de Argentina and Telecom Argentina to outperform from hold.</p>
<p>-- In a Feb 3 analysis, the firm said the Argentine government's decision on a tariff rebalancing plan &quot;removes a key uncertainty which has prevented us from recommending&quot; the shares.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
